OL,3,AUS diesel prices hit an all-time-high
OL,4,
OL,5,FDrivers in the US are paying more than
OL,6,Fever for diesel at the pump as the
OL,7,FUS-Israel war with Iran continues to
OL,8,Fhit Americans' wallets.
OL,10,FThe average price for one gallon of
OL,11,Fdiesel in the US has hit $5.85,
OL,12,Fcompared to an average of $3.71 a year
OL,13,Fago and above the previous high
OL,14,Ffollowing Russia's full-scale invasion
OL,15,Fof Ukraine, according to the American
OL,16,FAutomobile Association (AAA).
OL,18,FFuel prices have soared since the Iran
OL,19,Fconflict began at the end of February,
OL,20,Fmirroring the surge in wholesale oil
OL,21,Fprices.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
