OL,3,AUS diesel prices hit an all-time-high
OL,4,
OL,5,FIn response, US President Donald Trump
OL,6,Frecently pledged to "substantially
OL,7,Flower Gas Prices for all Americans"
OL,8,Fthrough an oil deal with Venezuela,
OL,9,Fwhich the US invaded in January.
